      "title": "7 mins ago | National 73 Home Minister Amit Shah says, 3 new criminal laws are aimed at providing time-bound justice throu... Union Home Minister Amit Shah said that the three new criminal laws introduced by the Modi Government, replacing the colonial-era laws, are based on three important pillars – technology, timeline and trust. Mr Shah said the objective of the new criminal laws is to ensure justice to citizens through a system that is more technology-driven and time-bound. The Home Minister was participating in the presentation ceremony of the President’s Police Colour to the Puducherry Police at the Police Trainin...",
